# Cloudflare Pages redirects — copied into the export root by the build.
#
# 2026-08-13: Qubani ka Meetha was retired (the shop never made it), the
# hyderabadi-specials category merged into sweets, and Hyderabadi Mixture was
# renamed Special Mixture. All three URLs are in Google's index and in the
# old sitemap, so they 301 to their successors instead of 404ing.
# Exact-match lines first: on Cloudflare Pages a `/foo/*` splat does not match
# the bare `/foo`, and with the page assets gone the bare form no longer gets
# the automatic 308 to the slash form — it must be caught here explicitly.
/category/hyderabadi-specials /category/sweets/ 301
/product/qubani-ka-meetha /category/sweets/ 301
/product/hyderabadi-mixture /product/special-mixture/ 301
/category/hyderabadi-specials/* /category/sweets/ 301
/product/qubani-ka-meetha/* /category/sweets/ 301
/product/hyderabadi-mixture/* /product/special-mixture/ 301
